Package: motanka-source-noble
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: motanka-archive-keyring, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: motanka-source
Conflicts: motanka-source-noble-edge,
           motanka-source-resolute,
           motanka-source-resolute-edge,
Replaces: motanka-source-noble-edge,
          motanka-source-resolute,
          motanka-source-resolute-edge,
Description: Motanka apt source for Ubuntu 24.04 LTS, stable channel
 Motanka is an Omarchy-compatible Hyprland layer for Ubuntu. This package
 installs the apt source of the Motanka repository suite "noble" (stable
 channel for Ubuntu 24.04 LTS), signed by the key in
 motanka-archive-keyring. Only one motanka-source package can be
 installed at a time.

